2DO board
=========

Version 3.0.0
In-world teleporter board for 2DO events server.

Get the latest version
* in-world at Speculoos Lab: speculoos.world:8002:Lab
* or from Kitely Market: https://www.kitely.com/market/product/50129545

The board fetches upcoming events from 2do.directory (or a self-hosted aggregator).
Touch an event row to teleport to the event location.
A click on the banner opens the full calendar at https://2do.directory/


Installation
-------------
* Just rez the object and let the magic happen.
* A "Configuration" notecard can be added for customization (see below).


Rendering modes
----------------
* Server renderer (default): the server generates a PNG image of the board.
  Currently only available with default API v3 events source.
* OSdraw renderer: the board draws text locally using osDrawText.
  Use renderer=osdraw to enable. Falls back automatically for custom sources.


Configuration
-------------
Create a notecard named "Configuration" inside the prim.
Keys are case-insensitive. Both camelCase and ALL_CAPS_UNDERSCORE are accepted.
For better performance, limit the configuration to the keys with actual custom
values, avoid keeping default values or comments in the notecard.
Some layout configurations might not yet be supported with server-side rendering.

eventsURL = https://yourgrid.org/events.php
//  Custom events source URL (osdraw-compatible). Leave empty to use the official API.
renderer = server
//  server  → server-side PNG image (API v3, default)
//  osdraw  → client-side LSL text renderer
refreshTime = 1800
//  Refresh interval in seconds.
showPastEvents = FALSE
//  Set TRUE to include events that have ended recently.
activeSides = 2,4
//  Comma-separated list of prim face numbers to apply the board to.
ratio = 0
//  Face aspect ratio (width/height). 0 = auto-detect from prim scale.
ratioCap = 0.25
//  Faces with ratio outside [ratioCap, 1/ratioCap] are skipped (extreme side faces).
textureWidth = 512
textureHeight = 512
//  Texture resolution in pixels. Must be powers of two (256, 512, 1024…).

bannerImageURL = https://yourgrid.org/banner.png
//  URL of the banner/logo image.
bannerHeight = 90
//  Banner area height in pixels.

backgroundColor = white
fontColor = black
colorPast = lightGray
colorStarted = darkGreen
colorSoon = darkBlue
colorToday = gray
colorLater = lightGray
colorHour = darkMagenta

//  Font availability depends on fonts installed on the simulator, not the viewer.
mainFontName = Junction
mainFontSize = 16
hourFontName =
hourFontSize = 12
lineHeight = 28
cellPadding = 0

teleportMethod = dialog
//  dialog    → confirmation dialog before teleporting (default)
//  teleport  → direct teleport
//  map       → open map

updateWarning = TRUE
//  Set FALSE to suppress update notifications.

sendSimInfo = FALSE
//  Set TRUE to send simulator info to the aggregator with each request.
//	Info received by the server are used only for statistical purposes.

